	"title": "Sword Coast Adventurer's Guide",
	"description": "<p><strong>Welcome to the Sword Coast</strong></p>\r\n<p>The Sword Coast Adventurer&rsquo;s Guide is a valuable resource to start any game in the Sword Coast. Giving details to the region of the Forgotten Realms, the sourcebook comprises shining paragons of civilization, perilous locales fraught with evil, and a wilderness that offers an explorer both vast opportunity and great danger.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&bull; Unlocks <strong>1 race</strong>, <strong>the feral tiefling</strong>, and <strong>7 subraces</strong> to use in creating characters in the guided Character Builder&nbsp;<br />&bull;&nbsp;Adds <strong>11 new subclasses</strong>, <strong>12 backgrounds</strong>, and <strong>4 spells</strong> to customize your character<br />&bull;&nbsp;Gives details of the factions that populate the Sword Coast to <strong>create unique adventures and quests</strong> for your party</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Continue in the&nbsp;Forgotten Realms with these adventures:<br />-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/tashas-cauldron-of-everything?icid_medium=crosspromo\" target=\"_blank\">Tasha's Cauldron of Everything</a><strong><a href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/sourcebooks/players-handbook?icid_source=dmgmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo\" target=\"_blank\"><br /></a></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/adventures/icewind-dale-rime-of-the-frostmaiden?icid_source=scagmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=iwd\">Icewind Dale: Rime of the Frostmaiden</a>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/adventures/baldurs-gate-descent-into-avernus?icid_source=scagmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=bg\">Baldur&rsquo;s Gate: Descent into Avernus</a>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-<span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">&nbsp;<a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/marketplace/adventures/waterdeep-dragon-heist?icid_source=scagmp&amp;icid_medium=crosspromo&amp;icid_campaign=wdh\">Waterdeep: Dragon Heist</a></span></span></p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p>This purchase unlocks the contents of this source for use with D&amp;D Beyond, including the book in digital format in the game compendium&nbsp;and access options from the book in the searchable listings, character builder, and digital sheet.</p>",
